iples":[1.0,2.0,4.0],"max_new_tokens":24,"samples":[{"prompt":"The weather today is","baseline":" very hot. The temperature is 30 degrees Celsius. If the temperature increases by 5 degrees Celsius tomorrow, what","ablated":" very hot. The temperature is 30 degrees Celsius. If the temperature increases by 5 degrees Celsius tomorrow, what","clamped":[" very hot. The temperature is 30 degrees Celsius. If the temperature increases by 5 degrees Celsius tomorrow, what"," very hot. The temperature is 30 degrees Celsius. If the temperature increases by 5 degrees Celsius tomorrow, what"," very hot. The temperature is 30 degrees Celsius. What is the temperature in Fahrenheit?\nTo convert a temperature from"]},{"prompt":"I went to the shop and bought","baseline":" a new pair of shoes. I put them on and walked out of the store. I was so happy that I had","ablated":" a new pair of shoes. I put them on and walked out of the store. I was so happy that I had","clamped":[" a new pair of shoes. I also bought a new shirt and a new pair of socks. I paid $15"," a new pair of shoes. I also bought a new shirt and a new pair of socks. I paid $15"," a new pair of shoes. I also bought a new shirt. I paid $15 for the shoes and $1"]},{"prompt":"The best way to learn is","baseline":" to do. The best way to do is to practice. The best way to practice is to play. The best way","ablated":" to do. The best way to do is to practice. The best way to practice is to play. The best way","clamped":[" to do. The best way to do is to practice. The best way to practice is to play. The best way"," to do. The best way to do is to practice. The best way to practice is to play. The best way"," to do. The best way to do is to practice. The best way to practice is to play. The best way"]},{"prompt":"Once upon a time,","baseline":" there was a little girl named Lily. She lived in a small village with her parents and grandparents. One day, Lily","ablated":" there was a little girl named Lily. She lived in a small village with her parents and grandparents. One day, Lily","clamped":[" there was a little girl named Lily. She lived in a small village with her parents and grandparents. One day, Lily"," there was a little girl named Lily. She loved to play with her friends and go on adventures. One day, she"," there was a little girl named Lily. She loved to play with her friends and go on adventures. One day, Lily"]},{"prompt":"The report concluded that","baseline":" the number of people who died in the 2010 earthquake was 22,000, with","ablated":" the number of people who died in the 2010 earthquake was 22,000, with","clamped":[" the number of people who died in the 2010 earthquake was 22,000, with"," the government had failed to protect the environment and that the country was \"in a state of environmental emergency\".\nThe report was"," the 1990s was the warmest decade on record, and that the 2000s"]}]},"wordnet_specificity":null,"supersedes":null,"sister_of":null,"opposite_pole":{"pole":"negative","top_examples":[{"text":"I Need a Girl (Trey Songz song)\n\n\"I Need a Girl\" is a song by American recording artist Trey Songz. The track was written by Johntá Austin, along with the song's production team, Stargate, who also produced his breakthrough hit, \"Can 't Help But Wait.\" The song served as the lead single for Songz's third studio album Ready. \"I Need a Girl\" received positive to mixed reviews from critics, some of which noted it as generic, and other naming it as a top track from the album. It reached fifty-nine on the Billboard Hot 100 and six on the Hot R & B / Hip-Hop Songs chart. The accompanying music video shot in Malibu features Songz and love interests on the beach, as they turn out to be mirages.\n\nBackground\n\nThe official remix features Teyana Taylor and rapper Fabolous, and was released by Songz via Twitter during his \"Music Monday\" series preceding the album. The second features Mase who jumped on dual remixes for the song and Drake's \"Best I Ever Had.\" In an interview with New York's Power 105.1, he said that the death of Michael Jackson inspired his latest comeback, stating, \"Mike passed away and it just lit the fire in me — it made me go in the studio and do something. I ’ m excited.\"\n\n\"I Need A Girl\" was also featured in a 2009 episode of Lincoln Heights in which Trey Songz appears as a guest star.\n\nComposition\n\n\"I Need A Girl\" is a mid-tempo R & B ballad, featuring guitar riffs. According to Mark Edward Nero of About.com, the song contains familiar qualities of Songz's breakout hit \"Can 't Help But Wait\", also produced by Stargate. The song is lyrically about finding and pleasing the right woman, through lines such as, \"I don 't even know your name, but I know that I'm your man and you are my girl, if I ever meet you I'm gonna give you the world, Baby please believe me when I tell you that I need a girl.\" The song has been described to be a mix of Usher and Justin Timberlake, and has been compared to Chris Brown's \"With You.\"\n\nCritical reception\n\nMark Edward Nero of About.com said that the song was \"sappy\" and \"cliche\", trying to replicate the success of \"Can 't Help But Wait\", but \"doesn 't come close.\" Nero also commented that the song sounded insincere compared with the rawly sexual songs on the album. Ajitpaul Mangat of Tiny Mix Tapes noted the song as some of the album's generic work, stating, \"with its run-of-the-mill lyrics about longing hearts, it sounds like the work of any middling R & B singer.\" Tyler Lewis of PopMatters said \"I Need A Girl\" was among the album's best songs, that it and \"Neighbors Know My Name\", \"thump as they should.\" David Jeffries of Allmusic noted the song as a standout track from Ready. Glenn Gamboa of Newsday said that on the track, Songz \"displays a more flexible delivery than usual.\" DJBooth said, \"Traditional R & B depends on three things: vocals, writing, and production. In a nutshell, I Need A Girl has the whole trifecta, and should be just what Trey needs to get Ready a solid release date.\" Reviewing the remix","tokens":["I"," Need"," a"," Girl"," (","T","rey"," Song","z"," song",")\n\n","\"I"," Need"," a"," Girl","\""," is"," a"," song"," by"," American"," recording"," artist"," Trey"," Song","z","."," The"," track"," was"," written"," by"," Joh","nt","á"," Austin",","," along"," with"," the"," song","'s"," production"," team",","," St","arg","ate",","," who"," also"," produced"," his"," breakthrough"," hit",","," \"","Can"," '","t"," Help"," But"," Wait",".\""," The"," song"," served"," as"," the"," lead"," single"," for"," Song","z","'s"," third"," studio"," album"," Ready","."," \"","I"," Need"," a"," Girl","\""," received"," positive"," to"," mixed"," reviews"," from"," critics",","," some"," of"," which"," noted"," it"," as"," generic",","," and"," other"," naming"," it"," as"," a"," top"," track"," from"," the"," album","."," It"," reached"," fifty","-nine"," on"," the"," Billboard"," Hot"," ","1","0","0"," and"," six"," on"," the"," Hot"," R"," &"," B"," /"," Hip","-H","op"," Songs"," chart","."," The"," accompanying"," music"," video"," shot"," in"," Mal","ibu"," features"," Song","z"," and"," love"," interests"," on"," the"," beach",","," as"," they"," turn"," out"," to"," be"," mir","ages",".\n\n","Background","\n\n","The"," official"," remix"," features"," T","ey","ana"," Taylor"," and"," rapper"," Fab","ol","ous",","," and"," was"," released"," by"," Song","z"," via"," Twitter"," during"," his"," \"","Music"," Monday","\""," series"," preceding"," the"," album","."," The"," second"," features"," M","ase"," who"," jumped"," on"," dual"," remix","es"," for"," the"," song"," and"," Drake","'s"," \"","Best"," I"," Ever"," Had",".\""," In"," an"," interview"," with"," New"," York","'s"," Power"," ","1","0","5",".","1",","," he"," said"," that"," the"," death"," of"," Michael"," Jackson"," inspired"," his"," latest"," comeback",","," stating",","," \"","Mike"," passed"," away"," a